[{:db/id 17592186157369 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6db9e5d7-25dc-58b4-9c16-44c0fcc1885a"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186157370 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3460e358-579f-58c7-a5d7-39a789a5fd57" "question-c2971ed6-5542-5d1d-88ad-8eaa0189b83c"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-6db9e5d7-25dc-58b4-9c16-44c0fcc1885a" :question/id #uuid "6db9e5d7-25dc-58b4-9c16-44c0fcc1885a" :question/math-academy-id "q-90563" :question/problem "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{Var}[X].$ \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x}{8},\\, & 0\\le x\\le 4, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the variance using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\n \n\nFirst, we compute $\\text{E}[X]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}x\\cdot \\frac{x}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{3}}{24}|}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{x}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{{x}^{3}}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{4}}{32}|}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the variance is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =8-{(\\frac{8}{3})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f06a4c98-85ea-5abf-97e5-f6e83cf7c4d9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f06a4c98-85ea-5abf-97e5-f6e83cf7c4d9" :answer-field/id #uuid "f06a4c98-85ea-5abf-97e5-f6e83cf7c4d9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6c842f13-bb1e-5d21-b493-010d7f0540da" :answer-field/choices ["answer-41f13a11-98cd-524c-94dd-97a4fbc4171f" "answer-0318bf00-2d3f-5298-8b97-5d17613e6b6b" "answer-74f2f8bc-295e-5fe4-a4a6-d3b7d7856167" "answer-7b7f42e0-4cd6-596f-926f-79f899b2353f" "answer-6c842f13-bb1e-5d21-b493-010d7f0540da"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-41f13a11-98cd-524c-94dd-97a4fbc4171f" :answer/id #uuid "41f13a11-98cd-524c-94dd-97a4fbc4171f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{32}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0318bf00-2d3f-5298-8b97-5d17613e6b6b" :answer/id #uuid "0318bf00-2d3f-5298-8b97-5d17613e6b6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{45}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74f2f8bc-295e-5fe4-a4a6-d3b7d7856167" :answer/id #uuid "74f2f8bc-295e-5fe4-a4a6-d3b7d7856167" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{56}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7b7f42e0-4cd6-596f-926f-79f899b2353f" :answer/id #uuid "7b7f42e0-4cd6-596f-926f-79f899b2353f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c842f13-bb1e-5d21-b493-010d7f0540da" :answer/id #uuid "6c842f13-bb1e-5d21-b493-010d7f0540da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3460e358-579f-58c7-a5d7-39a789a5fd57" :question/id #uuid "3460e358-579f-58c7-a5d7-39a789a5fd57" :question/math-academy-id "q-90542" :question/problem "The continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x)$ stated below. Given that $\\text{E}[X]≈1.238\\,10,$ compute $\\text{Var}[X].$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places.\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}, & 0<x<1 \\\\ \\frac{2{x}^{2}}{7}, & 1\\le x<2, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the variance using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}],$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{2{x}^{2}}{7}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{2{x}^{4}}{7}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{3}}{9}|}_{0}^{1}+{\\frac{2{x}^{5}}{35}|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & ≈1.882\\,54\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the variance is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & ≈1.882\\,54-(1.238\\,10)^{2} \\\\  & ≈0.35\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nrounded to $2$ decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6650333f-c025-51a5-a378-c029fa0e7257"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6650333f-c025-51a5-a378-c029fa0e7257" :answer-field/id #uuid "6650333f-c025-51a5-a378-c029fa0e7257" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8bf7cc83-54a0-5743-8b82-6cb0c3edf10b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e0d20673-3891-5f28-8bad-da220755aac2" "answer-8bf7cc83-54a0-5743-8b82-6cb0c3edf10b" "answer-6c5d2e46-7d94-50ee-b4d4-0441d216d769" "answer-95c8e380-b538-578d-a3f6-902ea2bc3aa5" "answer-ca1dce7b-6deb-57f2-8cbd-7ac30d581779"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e0d20673-3891-5f28-8bad-da220755aac2" :answer/id #uuid "e0d20673-3891-5f28-8bad-da220755aac2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8bf7cc83-54a0-5743-8b82-6cb0c3edf10b" :answer/id #uuid "8bf7cc83-54a0-5743-8b82-6cb0c3edf10b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.35" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c5d2e46-7d94-50ee-b4d4-0441d216d769" :answer/id #uuid "6c5d2e46-7d94-50ee-b4d4-0441d216d769" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.52" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-95c8e380-b538-578d-a3f6-902ea2bc3aa5" :answer/id #uuid "95c8e380-b538-578d-a3f6-902ea2bc3aa5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.67" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ca1dce7b-6deb-57f2-8cbd-7ac30d581779" :answer/id #uuid "ca1dce7b-6deb-57f2-8cbd-7ac30d581779" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.96" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-c2971ed6-5542-5d1d-88ad-8eaa0189b83c" :question/id #uuid "c2971ed6-5542-5d1d-88ad-8eaa0189b83c" :question/math-academy-id "q-90604" :question/problem "The continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x)$ stated below. Given that $\\text{E}[X]=0.65,$ compute $\\text{Var}[X].$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places.\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5}, & 0<x<1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{{x}^{6}}, & 1\\le x, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the variance using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}],$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{4}{5}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{6}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{4{x}^{2}}{5}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{4{x}^{3}}{15}|}_{0}^{1}+{(-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}})|}_{1}^{\\infty } \\\\  & =0.6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the variance is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =0.6-(0.65)^{2} \\\\  & ≈0.18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nrounded to $2$ decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6e9f1040-3058-5f3d-9630-e92a11f56fc6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6e9f1040-3058-5f3d-9630-e92a11f56fc6" :answer-field/id #uuid "6e9f1040-3058-5f3d-9630-e92a11f56fc6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e65eccbf-8c6a-5683-ac70-619d1ff951ad" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e65eccbf-8c6a-5683-ac70-619d1ff951ad" "answer-da4f8333-7c39-5fd6-9779-58bd99eb91d9" "answer-485c7842-588b-51d3-8fd7-892f4cb6ee0d" "answer-522d10c3-4afd-53c7-b537-41d31c849e7f" "answer-37830293-bdeb-5123-98bd-4a580c5a69ae"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e65eccbf-8c6a-5683-ac70-619d1ff951ad" :answer/id #uuid "e65eccbf-8c6a-5683-ac70-619d1ff951ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da4f8333-7c39-5fd6-9779-58bd99eb91d9" :answer/id #uuid "da4f8333-7c39-5fd6-9779-58bd99eb91d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-485c7842-588b-51d3-8fd7-892f4cb6ee0d" :answer/id #uuid "485c7842-588b-51d3-8fd7-892f4cb6ee0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.54" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-522d10c3-4afd-53c7-b537-41d31c849e7f" :answer/id #uuid "522d10c3-4afd-53c7-b537-41d31c849e7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.65" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-37830293-bdeb-5123-98bd-4a580c5a69ae" :answer/id #uuid "37830293-bdeb-5123-98bd-4a580c5a69ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.78" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}]
